## Additional Terms - Commercial Modules

The following files are NOT covered by the MIT license above and are 
proprietary to the GalaxyEpoch Team:

- src/main/promo-core.js
- src/renderer/admin.html
- src/preload/admin-preload.js

These files contain commercial logic (promotion links, commission tracking,
admin authentication) and are NOT included in the open-source repository.

You MAY NOT:
1. Reverse-engineer, decompile, or disassemble these commercial modules
2. Modify, redirect, or interfere with the promotion/commission tracking logic
3. Replace or bypass the promotion link system to divert referral commissions
4. Distribute modified versions that alter the promotion or billing behavior

You MAY:
1. Fork, modify, and distribute all other source code under MIT terms
2. Build and run the application locally for development and testing
3. Submit pull requests that improve the open-source portions
4. Create your own promotion module by implementing the same interface
   (see src/main/promo-interface.js for the public API contract)

For commercial licensing inquiries, contact the GalaxyEpoch Team.
